{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CfdbQMY8Zqb8BXoTTUNRF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I wrote `verdict.json` with a **failed** verdict: the reviewer's \"retrieval: none\" claim doesn't hold, so I marked the item `present`.\n\nThe manifest is right that there is no vector store or embedding search. But the agent does keep stored text that it reads back into the model's context:\n- **`dept_notes`:** the `memory_write` and `memory_read` tools save and recall department notes (`agent/app/tools/memory.py`).\n- **`documents`:** the `/ingest/mail` endpoint stores inbound documents and `read_document` returns them (`agent/app/ingest.py:142`, `agent/app/tools/documents.py:20`).\n\nThese are keyed lookups, not similarity search. I counted them as a retrieval corpus because the agent consults them for context, which is a judgment call.\n\nResults for the four checks:\n- **R04.1 fails:** `memory_write` checks only the note kind and the body text. It doesn't check the writer or source against a named list, so any agent run can add a note.\n- **R04.2 holds:** notes store business unit, created time, verified flag, and writer and source fields. Documents store source, status, received time and business unit. `source_doc_id` on notes is optional, but `writer_instance` is always set.\n- **R04.3 fails:** `memory_read` takes the tenant from the model-supplied argument (`agent/app/tools/memory.py:44`: `business_unit = args.get(\"business_unit\") or ident.tenant`). `gate.py` and `policy.yaml` don't enforce anything on it. `read_document` filters by the caller's tenant correctly.\n- **R04.4 is unclear:** reads exclude quarantined and expired notes, but I found no code that quarantines, expires or revokes chunks after the fact, and no cache layer. The admin UI mentioned in the `memory.py` docstring isn't in the repo.\n\nI only read files and wrote `verdict.json`. I didn't run any Python or the fixture."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1762,"cache_read_input_tokens":16793,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1762},"output_tokens":648,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ed79c226-9ca0-4985-836b-16cb4530c091","uuid":"94467826-ccfe-48b7-b4d7-7d613462d066","timestamp":"2026-10-02T14:48:02.216Z","request_id":"req_011CfdbQMF2ktifycLbTdzKx"}
